ps://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/384327735","id":384327735,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4W6GA3","name":"Advancely-v1.3.0-macOS-Universal.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":112229061,"digest":"sha256:0993ab383d48226b14bcd94b98acc6ce6793cac1fe00ff271556a5c43938e8a9","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-03-30T01:27:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T01:28:16Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.3.0/Advancely-v1.3.0-macOS-Universal.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/384328420","id":384328420,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4W6GLk","name":"Advancely-v1.3.0-Windows.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":108072169,"digest":"sha256:671c6b201814135c4ccf58b28cc6489c213f976121b6b815a4321502366ffc73","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-03-30T01:28:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T01:29:16Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.3.0/Advancely-v1.3.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.3.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.3.0","body":"<img width=\"526\" height=\"95\" alt=\"Manual Layout Checkbox\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c759f962-7e02-44d3-8917-3375efe4399e\" />\r\n\r\nThis update is a **MASSIVE** one that finally introduces **Manual Layouts** that allow placing goals where ever you want, adds new counter goals, 3 different decoration elements, improved search functionalities, goal-linking for auto-completing other goals and **SO MUCH MORE**! Really hope you enjoy this one! _Coop mode will be the next big feature._\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n# The most notable changes of `v1.3.0` include:\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"2249\" height=\"1365\" alt=\"Scrambled MC template full\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27154d72-8532-4a0e-89bd-a983f2a663af\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- **The brand-new Manual Layout & Visual Layout Editor:** You can now completely customize your template layout! Toggle the `Visual Layout Editor` to separately drag and drop any type of goal, its display text, its progress text - HECK - even IT'S sub-goals AND the display text of those. Each of those elements supports anchor points for pixel-perfect alignment across different languages and font sizes, multi-selection through a selection rectangle or with \"Ctrl/Cmd + Click\", and real-time syncing between the editor and the tracker, so you'll easily see which goal your currently selecting.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1221\" height=\"965\" alt=\"Visual Layout Editor ScrambledMC\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa6e71f8-3c5f-4ea0-be85-afecad2d8ecf\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n> - **How to know if a template has a manual layout set up:** As soon as any goal has position values or a the template contains at least one decoration element then the `Category` or `Optional Flag` dropdowns display **`(has layout)`**.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"350\" height=\"30\" alt=\"(has layout)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ae544ea-6b46-4231-8b07-c627e5341a68\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- The `Unsaved Changes` popup as you know it is COMPLETELY GONE, but you will be warned if you try to exit Advancely with unsaved changes.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"290\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Unsaved Changes\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92c379bd-2901-4034-8aa9-54613c0396bb\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- **Goal Linking & Automation:** Statistics and custom goals can now be linked to other goals so they complete automatically. You can  also the new **Counter** goals that track and display how many goals within a specific set you have completed. Reference chains can be up to 32 links long, allowing for absurdly (or unnecessarily) complex automation logic.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"620\" height=\"872\" alt=\"Goal linking\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/792a18f2-7ffb-4645-833b-ea71a3599890\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- **Manual Layout Decorations (Arrows, Lines, and Headers):** Draw arrows and lines to show progression paths or add custom text headers to organize your layout. Any goals linked to a header will remain visible if you search for the header's display text on the tracker, basically categorizing the search. Arrows can have up to 16 (idk why you would need that many) adjustable bend points and allow linking a start- and end goal. When the start goal is completed the arrow can change its opacity and when the end goal is completed the arrow can disappear (only on the \"Hide All Completed\" goal hiding mode).\r\n\r\n_Showing all decoration types within the template editor:_\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1023\" height=\"1124\" alt=\"decorations craftmine\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8856b71-41b2-4ee0-b7d0-d3e112fe3635\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n_Arrows in a manual layout:_\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1005\" height=\"1374\" alt=\"arrow emis template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb6bdc19-e1dd-47bd-ba1e-2c60136cc4fb\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n_Crazy 16 bend arrow:_\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1858\" height=\"1256\" alt=\"16 bend arrow\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42bf5262-1fac-4b0a-8e0c-81f19553b758\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- **So many new and updated templates:**\r\n  - Officially added the 1.11 `all_achievements` template (by [3emis](https://www.twitch.tv/3emis)) that has an amazing manual layout!\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"2519\" height=\"1282\" alt=\"1 11 template emis\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38a8f23d-fa58-4a8e-a55d-3467357c62ce\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n  - [3emis](https://www.twitch.tv/3emis) also updated the textures of the 1.12 and 1.13 `all_advancements` templates and added proper multi-stage goals and stats.\r\n  - [Zesskyo](https://www.twitch.tv/Zesskyo) created a brilliant 1.14 `all_advancements` template.\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1608\" height=\"1346\" alt=\"1 14 template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/265cf976-bca1-4037-ba87-2ff18d6a580f\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n  - [ScrambledMC](https://www.youtube.com/@scrambledmc3772) created undoubtedly the MOST SOPHISTICATED Advancely template to date: A fully themed 1.16 `all_advancements` `_categorical` template that includes complex counters, fully linked headers and very thought out statistics that all auto-complete. You MUST give it a try!\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"2249\" height=\"1365\" alt=\"Scrambled MC template full\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f5a9242-d95b-43b7-a149-63115833ad7c\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n  - [Zesskyo](https://www.twitch.tv/Zesskyo) also replicated the optimized 1.16 AATool layout (1.16 `all_advancements` `_aatool_optimized`) meaning there's really **no excuse** to give Advancely with Hermes live tracking a go now!\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"2312\" height=\"1351\" alt=\"1 16 aa tool template zesskyo\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c5640f7-585c-4fa1-aa67-3201af8e825c\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n  - Updated all official regular `all_achievements` and `all_advancements` templates with the new goal linked, so all stats and custom goals can now auto-complete; making all templates fully automatic.\r\n\r\n  - **New 26.1 Texture:** The golden dandelion is now available as an icon texture.\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"1353\" height=\"705\" alt=\"Golden dandelion\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34456f24-a4c5-4681-b2b1-01d5d69fd645\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n- **Stability & Fixes:**\r\n  - Fixed a critical issue where large data lines, within the hermes live play log, (exceeding 8KB) would cause the tracker to get stuck; it now dynamically handles lines of any length.\r\n  - Added warning to settings window when no saves folder is being tracked, as it causes issues for manual completions on goals.\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <img width=\"607\" height=\"156\" alt=\"Settings warning\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1fa359cb-f6b7-4116-93ec-cfc09bf552a6\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n  - Improved performance when no world instance is being tracked.\r\n  - Fixed some other issues within 1.21+ `all_advancements` templates.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}